# No SPA catch-all. This site has no client-side routing.
# Each path is served directly from its own index.html in dist/.

# Exception: promo QR landing pages. The QR on an influencer's poster encodes
# /promo/<CODE>, and there is no file per code — one page reads the code off
# the path and looks it up. 200 rewrites (not 301) so the URL the scanner sees
# keeps the code in it.
/promo/*  /promo/index.html  200
